OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after man stabbed at
OL,4,Aproperty
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fman was stabbed to death on Monday
OL,8,Fnight.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports of an
OL,11,Fassault at a property in Knightrider
OL,12,FStreet, Maidstone, at about 22:20 BST,
OL,13,FKent Police said.
OL,15,FA man in his 40s was found with
OL,16,Finjuries consistent with a stab wound
OL,17,Fand died whilst being treated by
OL,18,Fparamedics at the scene, a police
OL,19,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
